<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Jones Apparel said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Jones Apparel said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer downgraded Jones Apparel Group Inc to market perform, a trading source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended Wednesday at 62-1/4.</p>
